# Project Agent Rules & Execution Constraints

## 1. 🚫 Prohibited Execution Commands (STRICT ENFORCEMENT)
The AI agent is **strictly prohibited** from automatically running:
- `npm run dev` (or any foreground dev server / preview server)
- `npm run render` (or any full MP4 rendering commands)
- `npx hyperframes render`
- Any command that performs long, blocking video encoding or starts foreground dev servers.

## 2. Allowed Verification Commands
When verifying changes or validating compositions, the agent may ONLY run:
- `npm run check` (static, layout, motion, contrast, and audio linting)
- `npx hyperframes snapshot --at <seconds>` (capturing specific preview frames)
- `npx hyperframes lint`

Rendering (`npm run render`) or running dev servers (`npm run dev`) may ONLY be executed when the human user explicitly asks for a render or dev preview in their prompt.
